<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Screenlock on Sebastian Hoß</title><link>https://seb.xn--ho-hia.de/tags/screenlock/</link><description>Recent content in Screenlock on Sebastian Hoß</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 06 Jan 2023 16:40:24 +0100</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://seb.xn--ho-hia.de/tags/screenlock/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Lock your screen on SwayWM</title><link>https://seb.xn--ho-hia.de/posts/sway-screenlock/</link><pubDate>Mon, 05 Apr 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://seb.xn--ho-hia.de/posts/sway-screenlock/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://swaywm.org/"&gt;SwayWM&lt;/a&gt; users can use &lt;a href="https://github.com/swaywm/swaylock"&gt;swaylock&lt;/a&gt; to lock their screen. Place the following key binding in your Sway configuration:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# lock your screen&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;bindsym &lt;span class="nv"&gt;$mod&lt;/span&gt;+Ctrl+l &lt;span class="nb"&gt;exec&lt;/span&gt; swaylock --color &lt;span class="m"&gt;000000&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;$mod+Ctrl+l&lt;/code&gt; will lock your screen and turn it to black. The &lt;code&gt;--color&lt;/code&gt; flag allows any color in the form of &lt;code&gt;rrggbb[aa]&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>